不需要使用任何工具，直接回答即可。", "reasoningExpanded": false, "reasoningDurationMs": 1056, "reasoningVisibility": "full"}, "kind": "deepThought", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T01:26:16.068Z"}, {"updatedAt": "2026-05-06T01:26:16.044Z", "deepThoughtCard": {"reasoningVisibility": "full", "reasoningDurationMs": 5347, "reasoningContent": "用户问我是什幺模型。这是一个简单直接的问题，我需要回答我是Spark健康助手，并说明我的功能和定位。\n\n不需要使用任何工具，直接回答即可。", "reasoningExpanded": false}, "id": "8A6E5997-966B-4B77-A274-AC7AF284D54B", "kind": "deepThought", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T01:26:10.697Z"}, {"text": "你好呀！我是 **Spark 健康助手**，专注于为你提供健康相关的建议和服务。\n\n我的核心能力包括：\n\n- **睡眠分析**：解读睡眠数据，帮你优化睡眠质量\n- **饮食营养**：记录和分析饮食结构，提供膳食建议\n- **运动健身**：查看步数、能量消耗和运动记录，制定运动计划\n- **健康知识**：解答玻尿酸、医美、常见健康问题等\n- **任务规划**：根据你的目标拆解可执行任务并创建提醒\n\n简单说，我是你身边的智能健康管家～ 有什么健康方面的问题或需求，尽管跟我说！", "id": "B7D2089D-D4C0-436B-9222-CD5C8F73A73E", "updatedAt": "2026-05-06T01:26:16.044Z", "kind": "text", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T01:26:11.811Z"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "aa72f5ea-1982-4769-92b8-f9c9605dbb1a", "role": "user", "model_name": "user", "client_message_id": "cacf9d82-665e-459e-b3ce-100eceb3e817", "server_message_id": "b4bccd97-11a2-4a2c-81f4-41356167e1b7", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-05-06T01:26:31.306000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-05-06T01:26:31.467781+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "blocks": [{"id": "19C5A7FE-A2B5-4AFC-BC7B-0709D06DA50D", "text": "哈哈哈不错不错", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T01:26:31.306Z", "updatedAt": "2026-05-06T01:26:31.306Z", "kind": "text"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}]}}
