ient_message_id": "8D794095-DFD7-4050-96B8-9B8BBAAA00DE", "role": "assistant", "thread_max_messages": 20, "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}", "thread_top_p": 1, "model_name": "deepseek-v4-pro", "blocks": [{"deepThoughtCard": {"reasoningContent": "Let me analyze the sleep data for the last three days. The tool returned data for May 4 and May 5, 2026. Let me check if May 6 data is included... It seems the results only include May 4 and May 5. Let me look again...\n\nThe results show:\n- 2026年5月4日\n- 2026年5月5日\n\nBut May 6 isn't shown. That might be because today (May 6) hasn't been recorded yet, or the data hasn't been collected. Let me work with what I have - May 4 and May 5. Since the task says \"最近三天\", and today is May 6, maybe May 6 data isn't available yet. Let me just note this and proceed with analysis of the two days available.\n\nLet me summarize the data:\n\n**May 4:**\n- Total time: 6h 45min\n- Sleep time: 6h 42min\n- Awake: 9min (2.2%)\n- REM: 1h 47min (26.4%)\n- Core: 3h 58min (58.7%)\n- Deep: 57min (14.1%)\n- Bedtime: ~23:32\n- Wake time: ~06:17\n\n**May 5:**\n- Total time: 6h 37min\n- Sleep time: 6h 2min\n- Awake: 41min (10.3%)\n- REM: 1h 30min (22.6%)\n- Core: 3h 52min (58.4%)\n- Deep: 40min (10.1%)\n- Bedtime: ~00:26\n- Wake time: ~07:03\n\nNow for the analysis:\n\n**睡眠时长是否充足：**\n- 一般成年人建议7-9小时睡眠\n- May 4: 6小时42分钟 - 略不足\n- May 5: 6小时2分钟 - 明显不足\n- 平均约6小时22分钟 - 不足\n\n**深睡比例：**\n- 一般深睡应占20-25%的总睡眠时间\n- May 4: 57分钟 / 402分钟 = 14.1% - 偏低\n- May 5: 40分钟 / 362分钟 = 10.1% - 明显偏低\n- 深睡比例不足\n\n**作息规律性：**\n- May 4 入睡: 23:32, 醒来: ~06:17\n- May 5 入睡: 00:26, 醒来: ~07:03\n- 入睡时间差异约54分钟，不太规律\n- May 5 入睡更晚，可能与May 4睡眠不足有关或周末作息改变\n\n**睡眠评分：**\nLet me score this on a scale of 1-100:\n\n- 时长评分: 6.37h average out of ideal 8h = ~80% → 约60分\n- 深睡比例: ~12.1% average, ideal 20-25% → 约50分\n- 清醒比例: May 4: 2.2% (好), May 5: 10.3% (差)\n- 入睡规律性: 差异大 → 约50分\n- REM比例: May 4: 26.4%, May 5: 22.6% - 基本正常 (理想20-25%)\n\nOverall, I'd give about 55-60/100.\n\n**问题点：**\n1. 睡眠时长不足（平均6.4小时，低于推荐7-8小时）\n2. 深睡比例严重偏低（平均约12%，理想为20-25%）\n3. 入睡时间不规律（23:32 vs 00:26）\n4. 5月5日夜间清醒时间过长（41分钟，占10.3%），睡眠碎片化严重\n5. 5月5日后半夜睡眠碎片化（06:06-07:03期间多次切换）\n\n**改进建议：**\n1. 固定入睡时间，建议每晚23:00-23:30上床\n2. 目标睡眠时长7.5小时，对应起床时间约6:30-7:00\n3. 增加深睡：睡前避免蓝光、保持卧室凉爽（18-22°C）、睡前可做轻度拉伸\n4. 减少夜间清醒：避免睡前摄入咖啡因/酒精、保持卧室黑暗安静\n5. 考虑白天适度运动（但避免睡前3小时内剧烈运动）\n\nLet me now format this nicely for the user.", "reasoningExpanded": false, "reasoningDurationMs": 31268, "reasoningVisibility": "full"}, "id": "752A794F-18E2-4B11-9333-88B23C04D94A", "createdAt": "2026-05-06T01:29:02.175Z", "kind": "deepThought", "updatedAt": "2026-05-06T01:29:02.175Z"}], "created_at": "2026-05-06T01:29:02.175Z", "thread_max_tokens": 4096, "tombstone": false, "thread_id": "AA72F5EA-1982-4769-92B8-F9C9605DBB1A", "thread_system_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}"}]}
